WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.110
Hello, and welcome to the Video LP for my
album, "This Machine Pwns n00bs." This album

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:10.740
has a lot of songs on it. You can click on
any of those songs over there, and you can

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.740
go and listen to those songs on YouTube.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:17.840
You can stream those songs all day and all
night for free. You can do whatever you want,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.110
as long as you have a connection to YouTube.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.570
And the great thing is you can also share
those songs. You can put them on your Tumblr;

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:27.359
you can tweet them; you can even share them
on your weblog.

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:33.000
It is fun, it is easy, and it's a free way
to enjoy my music. But, if you do enjoy my

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.460
music, you are welcome to buy the album if
you haven't already. It's available at dftba.com

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.980
or also on iTunes.

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:44.879
Also, if you would like to listen to the album
as it was designed to be listened to, you

00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:48.580
can just click on this "Play" button, and
you will be linked to a YouTube playlist that

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:53.629
will play the whole freakin' album for you,
and you can, uh, clean your office... which

00:00:53.629 --> 00:00:57.170
is what I need to do right now while listening
to good music. You don't even wanna see what

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:58.280
it looks like behind this.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:22.090
So I'm going to shut up now, and let you

00:01:22.090 --> 00:04:36.139
listen to the music.

